# MINDONE 11.09: DISABLED for testing (in the project issue registry).
# This property does NOT exist in the stock vendor/build.prop - we added it. With blur
# enabled, the compositor (pid 859) gets a blit failure 656 times per boot,
# "DpAsyncBlitStream:: this platform unsupport compress format", and right next to it in the log
# are BaseDepthController lines about applying blur to the launcher. In the same boot there are
# 444 dropped frames flagged JANK_COMPOSER (one for apps), in the categories
# LOCKSCREEN, NOTIFICATION_SHADE, LAUNCHER_APP - exactly where blur is applied.
# Test: build without it, reboot, recount both numbers.
# Restore the line if the correlation does not hold up.
